000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. CUSTUPD.
000300*  Charges the order fee to each customer of the day's orders.
000400*  Shares ORDREC with ORDMAIN as is, and CUSTREC with another
000500*  REPLACING prefix.
000600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000800 FILE-CONTROL.
000900     SELECT ORDER-FILE ASSIGN TO ORDIN
001000         FILE STATUS IS WS-ORD-STATUS.
001100     SELECT CUST-FILE ASSIGN TO CUSTMAST
001200         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001300         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
001400         RECORD KEY IS CU-CUST-ID
001500         FILE STATUS IS WS-CUST-STATUS.
001600 DATA DIVISION.
001700 FILE SECTION.
001800 FD  ORDER-FILE.
001900     COPY ORDREC.
002000 FD  CUST-FILE.
002100     COPY CUSTREC REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
002200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002300 01  WS-ORD-STATUS           PIC XX VALUE SPACES.
002400 01  WS-CUST-STATUS          PIC XX VALUE SPACES.
002500 01  WS-EOF                  PIC X VALUE 'N'.
002600     88  END-OF-ORDERS              VALUE 'Y'.
002700 01  WS-FEE                  PIC S9(3)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 2.50.
002800 01  WS-NEW-BALANCE          PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
002900 01  WS-REJECTS              PIC 9(5) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
003000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003100 MAIN-PARA.
003200     OPEN INPUT ORDER-FILE
003300          I-O CUST-FILE.
003400     PERFORM APPLY-FEE UNTIL END-OF-ORDERS.
003500     CLOSE ORDER-FILE CUST-FILE.
003600     GOBACK.
003700 APPLY-FEE.
003800     READ ORDER-FILE
003900         AT END
004000            SET END-OF-ORDERS TO TRUE
004100         NOT AT END
004200            MOVE OR-CUST-ID TO CU-CUST-ID
004300     END-READ.
004400     IF NOT END-OF-ORDERS
004500        READ CUST-FILE
004600            INVALID KEY
004700               ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTS
004800            NOT INVALID KEY
004900               COMPUTE WS-NEW-BALANCE = CU-BALANCE + WS-FEE
005000                   ON SIZE ERROR
005100                      ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTS
005200               END-COMPUTE
005300               MOVE WS-NEW-BALANCE TO CU-BALANCE
005400               REWRITE CU-CUSTOMER
005500                   INVALID KEY ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTS
005600               END-REWRITE
005700        END-READ
005800     ELSE
005900        DISPLAY 'ORDERS DONE, REJECTED ' WS-REJECTS
006000     END-IF.
